---
import StaticPageLayout from "../layouts/StaticPageLayout.astro";

export const prerender = true;
---

<StaticPageLayout path="/privacy-policy">
  <section class="bg-gradient-to-br from-kaizen-dark via-slate-900 to-kaizen-dark py-16 text-white md:py-24">
    <div class="container mx-auto px-4">
      <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl text-center">
        <h1 class="mb-6 text-5xl font-heading font-bold md:text-6xl">Privacy Policy</h1>
        <p class="text-xl text-white/70">
          We're required to have this. You have a right to know what's happening with your data. Here's the simple, no-jargon version.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="bg-white py-20 md:py-28">
    <div class="container mx-auto px-4">
      <div class="prose prose-lg mx-auto max-w-3xl text-kaizen-text-dark/80">
        <h2 class="font-heading text-kaizen-dark">Our Core Philosophy</h2>
        <p>
          Our business is built on trust. We have no interest in selling your data or sending you spam.
          This policy explains what little data we do collect and why we need it to run our business.
        </p>

        <h2 class="font-heading text-kaizen-dark">What Data We Collect & Why</h2>
        <h3 class="font-heading text-kaizen-dark">Data You Give Us Directly</h3>
        <p>
          When you use our live chat or contact form, you may provide your name or email. We use this data only to
          communicate with you for that specific conversation or enquiry.
        </p>

        <h3 class="font-heading text-kaizen-dark">Data We Collect Automatically</h3>
        <p>Like most websites, we use a few tools that collect non-personal data. This includes:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>
            <strong>Essential Cookies:</strong> our platform and tools use cookies to function, such as
            remembering your chat history or making booking flow work.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Analytics Cookies:</strong> we use standard analytics to understand usage patterns and
            improve site performance.
          </li>
        </ul>

        <h2 class="font-heading text-kaizen-dark">What We Will Never Do</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>We will never sell your data to any third party.</li>
          <li>We will never send you marketing spam you did not ask for.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2 class="font-heading text-kaizen-dark">Your Rights (GDPR)</h2>
        <p>
          You have the right to request access to the data we hold about you, and the right to request deletion.
          Contact us via live chat or email <strong>privacy@kaizenweb.co.uk</strong> and we will handle it promptly.
        </p>

        <p>
          For more details on cookies, see our
          <a href="/cookie-policy" class="font-semibold text-kaizen-cyan no-underline hover:underline"> Cookie Policy</a>.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</StaticPageLayout>
